      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اخبى</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِخْبَآءٌ</span>; (Ks, TA;) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اخبى خِبَآءٌ</span>;
(S, K;) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تخبّى</span></b> , (Ks, TA,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تخبّى خِبَآءً</span>;
(S, K;) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خِبَآءً</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خبّى</span></b> , (S, * K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَخْبِيَةٌ</span>;
(S;) <i>He made a</i> [<i>tent such as is called</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خبآء</span>:
(Ks, S, K:) and <i>he set it up.</i> (K.) [see also
10.] And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَخْبَيْتُ كِسَائِى</span> <i>I made my</i> [<i>garment
called</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كسآء</span> <i>to be</i> [<i>as</i>] <i>a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خِبَآء</span>. (TA.)

